  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preservation Historical, Cultural Sites</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Recuperacin Patrimonio Cultural</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM FOCUSSES ON RESTORING URBAN HISTORICAL AND CULTURAL SITES AND MAKING THEM SELF-SUSTAINING WITHOUT FURTHER FEDERAL ASSISTANCE. THE PROGRAM COMPRISES ACTIONS IN VARIOUS CITIES INCLUDING: EMERGENCY REPAIRS, RESTORATION OF BUILDINGS AND MONUMENTS, REHABILITATION OF PUBLIC AREAS, INCENTIVES FOR PRIVATE RESTORATION WORK, URBAN INFRASTRUCTURE IN THE HISTORICAL AREAS, TRAINING FOR RESTORATION SPECIALISTS, AND INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
